{"unit_id":"zhaochengbiao005__dsh-gcua#card-zh","repo":"zhaochengbiao005/dsh-gcua","commit":"b06e46ab021c28d61308eb441c5477e98eb982a7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"GCUA 为 DSH 提供面向桌面操作的状态机工具，包含 gcua_step、gcua_status 和 gcua_reset，并向系统提示词加入观察、行动与验证的工作流程。gcua_step 将一段 Python 步骤交给独立 worker 执行；台账记录任务状态，步骤轨迹与 stall guard 帮助模型跟进进展。用户可用它批量执行 GUI 自动化、查看任务台账和开始新任务。实现依赖 Windows 图形环境及 Python，GUI 操作需要 pyautogui 和 mss，UI Automation 需可选安装 pywinauto。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:102-203","engine/gcua.py:198-269"]}
{"unit_id":"zhaochengbiao005__dsh-gcua#card-en","repo":"zhaochengbiao005/dsh-gcua","commit":"b06e46ab021c28d61308eb441c5477e98eb982a7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"GCUA adds desktop automation tools to DSH. gcua_step runs Python actions in a worker; gcua_status and gcua_reset manage the task ledger. A system prompt guides observe-act-verify workflows. Use it to batch GUI tasks and track progress. Needs Windows, Python, pyautogui and mss; pywinauto is optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:102-203","engine/gcua.py:198-269"]}
